TeX Gyre Heros (regular + bold OpenType only)
GUST e-foundry — a Helvetica clone, the face NeXTSTEP UI actually used.
Upstream: https://www.gust.org.pl/projects/e-foundry/tex-gyre/heros
Files: vendor/next/fonts/texgyreheros-regular.otf
       vendor/next/fonts/texgyreheros-bold.otf
Unmodified. GUST Font License (GFL) follows; GFL is LPPL 1.3c plus a
name-change request for derived works. Embedding the unmodified faces
does not require renaming.

